/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Save is Unique</strong> – No two playthroughs are the same! Customers, events, and challenges change with each game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather Affects Business</strong> – A rainy day might mean more customers—how will you adapt?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surprises Await</strong> – Uncover hidden events and unexpected twists as you grow your café.</p></li></ul>",
